OL,3,GNEWSACelebrated Irish musician Donal
OL,4,ALunny dies aged 79
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of Ireland's most-celebrated
OL,7,Ftraditional musicians and
OL,8,Fmulti-instrumentalists, Donal Lunny,
OL,9,Fhas died aged 79.
OL,11,FA founding member of three renowned
OL,12,Fbands - The Bothy Band, Planxty and
OL,13,FMoving Hearts - he was widely credited
OL,14,Ffor the revival and growth of Irish
OL,15,Ftraditional music.
OL,17,FHe also composed and wrote scores for a
OL,18,Fwide range of projects including TV
OL,19,Fdramas, documentaries and films.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
