OL,5,
OL,6,FIn recent years he worked with
OL,7,Fcontemporary artists such as Kate Bush,
OL,8,FRod Stewart, Elvis Costello, Clannad
OL,9,Fand Dire Straits frontman Mark
OL,10,FKnopfler.
